<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9120"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Verm_inve<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Verm_inve<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 10:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Family 1574.  Hugo Palmer Dietz &#34;Palmer&#34;, s of Otto Dietz &amp; Anna Elisabeth Fabrizius &#40;Family 1573&#41;, b 1 Feb 1923 WaKeeney Trego Co KS.  He m 25 Sep 1946 to Eileen Howard.  She b 11 May 1926.  They have 3 dau: <BR>    i Paula Dietz, 1948-.  See Family 1575. <BR>   ii Sharon Dietz, 1949-.  See Family 1576. <BR>  iii Donna Dietz, 1951-.  See Family 1577. <BR> <BR>Family 1575.  Paula Dietz, dau of Hugo Palmer Dietz &#34;Palmer&#34; &amp; Eileen Howard, b 5 May 1948.  She m 22 May 1971 to Dennis L. Rader.  He b 9 Mar 1945.  They have 2 ch: <BR>    i Brian Howard Rader, b 27 Jul 1975 Wichita Sedgwick Co KS.  <BR>   ii Kerri Lynn Rader, b 13 Jun 1978 Wichita Sedgwick Co KS.  <BR> <BR>Family 1576.  Sharon Dietz, dau of Hugo Palmer Dietz &#34;Palmer&#34; &amp; Eileen Howard &#40;Family 1574&#41;, b 5 Dec 1949.  She m 4 Apr 1970 to Robert L. Dir.  He b 23 Aug 1946.  They have 2 dau: <BR>    i Andrea Dawn Dir, b 16 Mar 1974 Wichita Sedgwick Co KS.  <BR>   ii Michelle Lynette Dir, b 28 Sep 1975 Wichita Sedgwick Co KS; d 14 Aug 1996. <BR> <BR>Family 1577.  Donna Dietz, dau of Hugo Palmer Dietz &#34;Palmer&#34; &amp; Eileen Howard &#40;Family 1574&#41;, b 11 Oct 1951.  She m 29 May 1972 to Craig Woolington.  They have 2 s: <BR>    i Jason Allen Woolington, b 14 Dec 1974 Topeka Shawnee Co KS. <BR>   ii Aaron Dean Woolington, b 16 Apr 1980 Topeka Shawnee Co KS. <BR>They div. <BR> <BR>Addresses were deleted ... Michelle, a cousin of the children, apparently died young.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9120-->
