<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9405"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Screamer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Screamer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 1:32 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->He graduated WSU in 1979. Was he working at Coleman at the time, or in the military? Is there a Otero connection because of military or Coleman? Where did this monster go to high school?  <BR> <BR>Just a few questions that have been bothering me...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
