<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9458"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Marga<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Marga<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 12:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The Kansas.com/Eagle has excellent photos. Go to this link: <a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/11002959.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/11002959.htm</a> <BR> <BR>and click on the &#34;More Photos&#34; link under Rader&#39;s mugshot. The 4th photo is a yearbook photo, &#34;Dennis Rader’s senior picture taken from the 1963 Heights High School yearbook, the Talon&#34;. Rader as a 17&#40;18?&#41;-year-old. Was he already a killer, then? I&#39;ll bet he was.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
