<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9663"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 1:38 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;ve got to go with Jack. <BR> <BR>HEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEERE&#39;s Denny! <BR> <BR>Embersage: How about adding weddings, births, graduations and reunions etc.? I&#39;ll go to your thread with some dates.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
