<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9719"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 10:38 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You all know one reason I immediately decided for me he would henceforth be Denny the &#40;Deadly&#41; Dog Catcher was; <BR> <BR>&#42; Someone who would never let others call him &#34;Denny&#34;. <BR> <BR>&#42; Using his glorified, $30,000 a year Dog Catcher position to get his power jones, and would probably be insulted if called the &#34;Dog Catcher&#34; to his face - he&#39;d insist he was the &#34;Compliance Officer!!&#34; <BR> <BR>&#42; Finally revealed for the inadequate little man he truly was, who for a while his only success in life, if you think about it, was staying free all those years.  <BR> <BR>To no longer call him by his chosen name, an acronym that terrified Wichitans for so long, for me was a way of taking his power away and labeling him as the loser he truly is. These guys always turn out to be losers. Think about it. He spent most of the 70&#39;s a perennial student at WSU, got a degree that should have predicted an entry into police work, and never got better than dog catcher and grass-measurer. He was a weenie and a weasel and his taunting of the police was his way of proving to them he was not just worthy of being one of their number, but in his mind superior. In spite of the fact that his everyday life showed the opposite. <BR> <BR>BTK was a phantom, a puppeteer. He lurked in the dark of Wichita&#39;s suburban nightmares. <BR> <BR>Denny the Dog Catcher is a little weaselly man with a molester mustache who was so petty that he measured neighbors&#39; grass with a rule to see if they were in &#39;compliance&#39; or not. And he will crumble in prison. I actually hope he gets life - among the general population. He&#39;ll be punked or just straight-out shanked faster than you can say &#34;I want to report a home-icide at 843 South Pershing...&#34; <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9719-->
