<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9985"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsbarn<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsbarn<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 2:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey Johno, <BR> <BR>I &#42;think&#42; that last link I posted of the family tree is the correct Dennis R. Here it is again: <BR> <BR><a href="http://66.102.7.104/search?q=cache:0MJ1HZyQOfAJ:familytree.paradigmpress.net/f_25f.htm%2B%22Paul%2BRader%22%2BDennis%2BWichita&amp;hl=en&amp;start=7" target=_top>http://66.102.7.104/search?q=cache:0MJ1HZyQOfAJ:fa milytree.paradigmpress.net/f_25f.htm&#43;%22Paul&#43;Rader %22&#43;Dennis&#43;Wichita&amp;hl=en&amp;start=7</a>  <BR> <BR>The birthdates and possible whereabouts appear to be estimates &#40;birth year listed as &#34;C. 1950&#34; &amp; whereabouts as &#34;prob. Wichita&#34;&#41;, so I suspect this family tree was written by someone not too involved with the DR family. ANYWAY, I have seen references that he has brothers named Jeff and Paul, two of his three brothers, and this would correspond to this link&#39;s information. Then again, it could be the non-related Ocean Opry family.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
