<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10085"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 10:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><i>&#34;...Steve sounds tired...&#34;</i> <BR> <BR>You could say that. It&#39;s not all BTK, but it hasn&#39;t helped. My littlest kinder, my son, was cutting some new molars and making life hell, now his sleep cycle is screwed, so mine is too, for a bit. <BR> <BR>Ole Denny, a <b>knot-tying</b> expert!! <BR> <BR>WHO&#39;D A THUNK IT?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
