<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10191"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Zenith<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Zenith<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 2:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m kind of betting some of his freakazoid behavior with taunting LE goes back to some type of problem he had with getting hired in LE. He got a criminal justice degree, and although he&#39;s been steadily employed for a lot of years, working at Coleman, then as ADT tech., then as dog catcher probably wasn&#39;t what he expected from a CJ degree. I won&#39;t be surprised at all to find out he didn&#39;t get hired in LE and he&#39;s been paying them back all this time by showing them how he&#39;s smarter than they are.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
