com &#60;<a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/16.html" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/16.html</a>&#62;&#41;; presumed to be from BTK <BR>|- 5/5: KAKE tv receives &#34;The BTK Story&#34;, a rambling autobiography patterned after Crime Library&#39;s BTK feature &#60;<a href="http://www.crimelibrary.com/serial_killers/unsolved/btk/index_1.html" target=_top>http://www.crimelibrary.com/serial_killers/unsolve d/btk/index_1.html</a>&#62;, included are two phoney photo ID&#39;s <BR>|- 6/17: WPD receives letter from BTK concerning Otero murders; a second letter is discovered the same day at the Wichita Public Library, contents not revealed <BR>|- 8/17: Jacob Allen; bound to rail road tracks <BR>|- 9/26: Carol Mould; c.o.d. unspecified, arson, items possibly missing from scene <BR>|- 11/30: WPD releases laundry list of clues &#40;view at catchbtk.com &#60;<a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/113004.pdf" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/113004.pdf</a>&#62;&#41; as to BTK&#39;s background and identity, asking for help from the public <BR>|- 12/8: unknown man, presumably BTK, calls quick mart alerting them to package left in Murdock Park; WPD searches park but finds nothing <BR>|- 12/14: citizen finds BTK package in Murdock Park containing Fox&#39;s drivers licence, as well as other unrevealed contents <BR>2002&#42;  <BR>6/4: Dorothy Slaughter beaten, died two weeks later, Mr. Slaughter &#40;survived&#41; beaten, telco cut, car keys stolen, home invasion <BR>2/20: body of Agnes Hayes found near bridge in Harvey County, KS; strangled, police believe crime originated in Wichita or Sedgwick County, known prostitute, body dumped [more] &#60;<a href="http://www.thekansan.com/stories/012805/localnews_0128050047.shtml" target=_top>http://www.thekansan.com/stories/012805/localnews_ 0128050047.shtml</a>&#62; <BR>|- 10/17: Melvin D. Childress; c.o.d. unspecified, body dumped in field, car found abandoned <BR>2001&#42;  <BR>2/20: body of Agnes Hayes found near bridge in Harvey County, KS; strangled, police believe crime originated in Wichita or Sedgwick County, known prostitute, body dumped [more] &#60;<a href="http://www.thekansan.com/stories/012805/localnews_0128050047.shtml" target=_top>http://www.thekansan.com/stories/012805/localnews_ 0128050047.shtml</a>&#62; <BR>|- 10/17: Melvin D. Childress; c.o.d. unspecified, body dumped in field, car found abandoned <BR>1999&#42; <BR>11/12: Tina Frederick; shot in home, blocks from Vians&#39; 8/2004: man incarcerated for another murder charged with Frederick crime <BR>|- 12/15: Opal J. Trumpp; murdered in basement with unspecified weapon, perp. fled on foot <BR>--2000-- <BR>1998&#42; <BR>2/10: Monte E. Dixon; shot in home <BR>|- 2/??: Thomas McCorgary &#40;Harvey County, KS&#41;; convicted murderer was poisoned with Zoloft &amp; morphine, while away from prison in hospital dieing from emphysyma [more] &#60;<a href="http://www.thekansan.com/stories/012805/localnews_0128050047.shtml" target=_top>http://www.thekansan.com/stories/012805/localnews_ 0128050047.shtml</a> <BR>1997&#42; <BR>5/11: Deanna Law found nude in bath tub, strangled, sexual assault, neighbor charged with the crime, but charges dropped despite his confession <BR>|- 6/6: Hattie Smith; strangled/drown <BR>1996&#42; <BR>6/??: Avanthea Williams; c.o.d. unknown, body dumped in abandoned building, known prostitute <BR>|- 9/12: Cherie Fox shot to death, home invasion <BR>| <BR>|- 12/26: JonBenet Ramsey &#40;Boulder, CO&#41;; strangled with garrote in basement, raped, bound, strange &#34;ransom note&#34; letter left in home <BR>Sedgwick County Animal Control advisory board, <BR>1994&#42; <BR>10/29: John Doe &#40;Sedgwick County, KS&#41;; body dumped, c.o.d. unspecified [more] &#60;<a href="http://www.sedgwickcounty.org/sheriff/operations/cold_cases/unknown.html" target=_top>http://www.sedgwickcounty.org/sheriff/operations/c old_cases/unknown.html</a>&#62; <BR>1993&#42; <BR>8/16: Kristi Hatfield found dead; blow to the back of the head, body dumped in field <BR>1991&#42; <BR>1/19: Delores &#34;Dee&#34; Davis abducted from home after dining as same restaurant as Marine Hedge &#40;see 1985&#41;, strangled, dumped body found 13 days later under bridge, bound, telco cut, items missing from home, car wiped down, but apparently not moved &#40;2/26/2005: WPD reclasified Davis as official BTK victim.&#41; <BR>1989&#42; <BR>10/02: Krista Martin beaten to death; blunt object to the back of the head, home invasion <BR>D. Rader worked for US census Bureau, as a field Operations Supervisor <BR>1988&#42; <BR>1/??: Mrs. Phillip &#40;Mary&#41; Fager receives letter from BTK which admires the Fager mass-murder, but denies responsibility <BR>- 9/14: Michael J. Fowler &#40;Sedgwick County, KS&#41;; c.o.d. unspecified, body dumped in rural area <BR>1987&#42; <BR>6/6: Hattie Smith bound, beaten, strangled, drowned in bathtub, home invasion, items missing <BR> 10/31: Shannon Olson, found stabbed following day, hands bound, body dumped in sand pit <BR> approx. 12/30: Phillip Fager, shot; Kelli Fager, nude and strangled: Sherri Fager, strangled, bound; Kelli and Sherri killed in basement hot tub; Bill Butterworth later tried for murders and acquitted <BR>1986&#42; <BR>9/16: Vicki Wegerle &#40;Wichita, KS&#41;, strangled, Wegerle car moved/abandoned, driver&#39;s license missing &#40;photocopy later included in 3/19/2004 BTK communique&#41; <BR>1985&#42; <BR>4/27: Marine Hedge abducted from home after returning from same restaurant as Delores Davis &#40;see 1991&#41;, found 8 days later strangled, body dumped in ditch, telco cut, Hedge car moved/abandoned, ID stolen &#40;2/26/2005: WPD reclassifies Hedge as official BTK victim.&#41; <BR>|- 6/29: Linda Shawn Casey; bound, beaten with &amp; sexual assault with wine bottle, stabbed, home invasion, telco cut, <BR>1984&#42; <BR>Attended reunion of his 8th grade class at RiverSide School <BR>1982&#42; <BR>6/25: Lupe Leo Ornelas; c.o.d. unspecified, body dumped in ditch, car found abandoned <BR>1980&#42; <BR>10/25: Barbara Smith; blow to head, attempted strangulation, arson <BR>1979&#42; <BR>|- 04/28: Anna Williams &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; aborted attack, perp. hid in home awaiting victims, but apparently got bored and left before they returned, telco cut <BR>|- 5/1: Jerry Hunter &#40;Valley Center, KS&#41;; c.o.d. unspecified, car found abandoned <BR>|- 8/15: WPD releases the BTK Nancy Fox phone call to the media and it is heard by the public for the first time <BR>Graduated from Wichita State University Degree in Criminal Justice <BR>1978&#42; <BR>|- 1/31: A &#34;Curley Locks&#34; style poem which refers to the Vian murder, stamped with lettering blocks on an index card, is received by The Wichita Eagle-Beacon, but is initially ignored <BR>|- 2/10: Another letter from BTK is received by KAKE tv; it contains a poem based on &#34;Oh, Death&#34;, demands more media coverage and takes credit for an extra, unattributed, victim &#40;now assumed to be Kathryn Bright&#41; <BR>|- 5/10: Karen, Scott &amp; Mark Pretty &#40;Houston, TX&#41;; strangled/drown, bound with telephone cord, bodies found in bathtubs, car abandoned at nearby apartment complex, home invasion, children murdered ~[more] &#60;&#60;<a href="http://members.tripod.com/bailey_t/index-3.html" target=_top>http://members.tripod.com/bailey_t/index-3.html</a>&#62;&#62; <BR>His daughter is born June 13, 1978. <BR>1977&#42; <BR>03/17: Shirley Vian &#40;Wichita, KS&#41;, bound and strangled with garrote, hooded with plastic bag, children left unharmed, home invasion- perp. knocked &amp; was invited in by children; neighbor boy apparently witnessed BTK knock on door of Vian neighbor &#34;Cheryl&#34;, and saw him proceed on to Vian&#39;s after he got no answer at first home. <BR>|- 6/23: Nina Berardi; shot, telco cut, children unharmed, home invasion <BR>|- 7/11: Sandra K. Talbott &#40;Wichita/El Dorado, KS&#41;; c.o.d. unspecified, body dumped near &#34;Twin Bridges&#34; <BR>|- 11/26: Denise Rathbun last seen; found 2 weeks later; died of drowning and exposure, body dumped in creek under bridge <BR>|- 12/08: Nancy Fox &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; bound and strangled, driver&#39;s license stolen &#40;later contained in BTK 2004 Murdock Park message drop&#41;, home invasion <BR>|- 12/08: BTK calls emergency hotline from payphone to report the Fox murder, a recording &#40;almost certainly edited&#41; of the call &#40;listen at catchbtk.com &#60;<a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/btk.wav" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/btk.wav</a>&#62;&#41; is later released by WPD <BR>1975&#42; <BR>|- 6/9: Carol Marsteller &#40;Sedgwick County/Wichita, KS&#41;; stabbed, body dumped... UPDATE 2/23/05: David Packard convicted &#60;<a href="http://www.dc.state.ks.us/kasper2/offender.asp?id=15497" target=_top>http://www.dc.state.ks.us/kasper2/offender.asp?id= 15497</a>&#62; of Marstellar murder in 3/1987, paroled 3/2004 [more at KAKE tv] &#60;<a href="http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/515277.html" target=_top>http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/515277.html</a>&#62; [more at catchbtk.com] &#60;&#60;<a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/8/85.html?1109184392" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/8/85.html? 1109184392</a>&#62;&#62; <BR>His son is born on July 27, 1975.  <BR>1974&#42; <BR>01/15: Joseph, Julie, Josephine, &amp; Joseph Jr. &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; strangled, telco cut, some bodies hooded, Otero car moved/abandoned, items taken, home invasion, children murdered <BR>|- 1/21: Bruce Douglas &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; body found; asphyxiated and enclosed in trunk of car in rural area N.E. of Wichita, WSU student, car abandoned, car left running, LE ruled &#34;accidental suicide&#34; [more] &#60;<a href="http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag=kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=5105.1" target=_top>http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag =kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=5105.1</a>&#62; <BR>|- 4/4: Kathryn Bright &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; strangled &amp; stabbed to death, Kevin 